ssh -i ~/.ssh/hng-infrastructure.pem ubuntu@<new-ip>

# Verify all services running (immediately, no manual steps)
sudo systemctl status prometheus node_exporter grafana-server | grep Active

# Confirm: all three show "active (running)"
```

**Result:** ✅ Success on third attempt - all services deployed automatically

