## Code Quality & Standards

### Infrastructure as Code Standards

✅ **Modular:** Separate modules for networking, security, compute, DNS, monitoring  
✅ **Version Controlled:** All code in Git with meaningful commit messages  
✅ **Reproducible:** Same Terraform code produces identical infrastructure  
✅ **Documented:** Each module includes comments and variable descriptions  
✅ **Idempotent:** Running terraform apply twice produces same result  

### Scripting Standards

✅ **Error Handling:** Scripts check for success/failure of each step  
✅ **Logging:** All actions logged to `/var/log/` for debugging  
✅ **Comments:** Complex sections explained inline  
✅ **Defensive:** Paths created before use, services verified before use  
✅ **Graceful Degradation:** Failures don't prevent entire deployment  

